   "x": 0,
   "y": 53340
  },
  "m11-note": {
   "maxH": 420,
   "text": "M11 decisions (proposed, docs/in-development/M11-sso-and-migration.md): SSO connections are install-wide (Settings › Single sign-on); groups map to brand roles and only SSO-sourced roles are synced. Imports live under Brand › Import, one brand at a time; nothing is sent to customers while importing; new HD numbers by default, the old number on the chip; no SLA timers until the admin starts them. Names, counts and URLs on these boards are sample values.",
   "w": 520,
   "x": 6960,
   "y": 55480
  },
